              %em Stable Vacua with Realistic Phenomenology and Cosmology in Heterotic M-theory Satisfying Swampland Conjectures
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.04828"}> arXiv:2401.04828
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h4#nonsupersymmetric_models_2 Non-supersymmetric models
          %p A survey of string model buidling without low energy susy is in
          %ul#MRS09
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emil+Martinec"}> Emil Martinec
              , Daniel Robbins, Savdeep Sethi,
              %em Non-Supersymmetric String Theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0904.3498"}> arXiv:0904.3498
              )
          %p An old observation on string models without low energy susy, recently re-appreciated, is
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Keith+Dienes"}> Keith Dienes
              ,
              %em How Strings Make Do without Supersymmetry: An Introduction to Misaligned Supersymmetry
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9409114"}> arXiv:hep-th/9409114
              )
          %p A newer observation that received much more attention is
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nima+Arkani-Hamed"}> Nima Arkani-Hamed
              , Savas Dimopoulos,
              %em Supersymmetric Unification Without Low Energy Supersymmetry And Signatures for Fine-Tuning at the LHC
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0405159"}> arXiv:hep-th/0405159
              )
